cff-version: 1.2.0
title: PandaForge - Interactive Robot Motion Planning & Manipulation Studio
message: >-
  If you use this software or its benchmark methodology, please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  - name: PandaForge Contributors
repository-code: "https://github.com/YOUR_GITHUB_USERNAME/pandaforge"
abstract: >-
  A desktop application (MuJoCo + PySide6) for interactive robot motion
  planning and physical manipulation with the Franka Emika Panda:
  damped-least-squares IK, RRT/RRT-Connect/RRT*/Informed-RRT* planning,
  TOPP-RA time-optimal trajectories, antipodal grasp selection with
  automatic side-grasp fallback, a physically verified pick-and-place state
  machine, and closed-loop replanning under a scripted moving obstacle.
keywords:
  - robotics
  - motion-planning
  - mujoco
  - inverse-kinematics
  - rrt
  - topp-ra
  - grasping
license: MIT
version: 1.3.1
date-released: "2026-10-25"
